      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>Lower&nbsp;Division&nbsp;Required&nbsp;Courses</strong></p><p><em>Must&nbsp;be&nbsp;taken&nbsp;at&nbsp;UC&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;unless&nbsp;articulated&nbsp;or&nbsp;approved&nbsp;by&nbsp;the&nbsp;department</em></p><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Two&nbsp;of&nbsp;the&nbsp;following&nbsp;are&nbsp;required:<strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><ul><li>AGRS&nbsp;10A&nbsp;or&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;17A</li><li>AGRS&nbsp;10B&nbsp;or&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;17B</li><li>AGRS&nbsp;R44&nbsp;(may&nbsp;be&nbsp;substituted&nbsp;for&nbsp;either&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;10A/17A&nbsp;or&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;10B/17B,&nbsp;but&nbsp;not&nbsp;both.)</li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Important&nbsp;Note&nbsp;on&nbsp;Community&nbsp;College&nbsp;Credit:</strong></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">Currently,&nbsp;there&nbsp;are&nbsp;no&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;courses&nbsp;formally&nbsp;articulated&nbsp;through&nbsp;Assist.org&nbsp;that&nbsp;satisfy&nbsp;these&nbsp;specific</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">Berkeley&nbsp;lower-division&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;(AGRS&nbsp;10A/17A,&nbsp;10B/17B,&nbsp;R44).</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">However,&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;taken&nbsp;similar&nbsp;courses&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;(sometimes&nbsp;referred&nbsp;to&nbsp;as&nbsp;Western&nbsp;Civilization</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">or&nbsp;similar&nbsp;broad&nbsp;surveys&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ancient&nbsp;Greece&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rome),&nbsp;they&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;to&nbsp;fulfill&nbsp;these&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;upon</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">departmental&nbsp;review&nbsp;and&nbsp;approval.</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">To&nbsp;request&nbsp;review&nbsp;for&nbsp;course&nbsp;articulation,&nbsp;please&nbsp;submit&nbsp;the&nbsp;course&nbsp;information&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;course&nbsp;syllabus&nbsp;to&nbsp;our</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">undergraduate&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;(contact&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;below).</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"></p><p><strong>Lower&nbsp;Division&nbsp;Elective&nbsp;</strong></p><p><em>May&nbsp;potentially&nbsp;be&nbsp;fulfilled&nbsp;by&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;credit</em></p><p><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>One&nbsp;lower&nbsp;division&nbsp;AGRS,&nbsp;GREEK&nbsp;or&nbsp;Latin&nbsp;course.</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"><strong>Note:</strong></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">If&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;taken&nbsp;relevant&nbsp;courses&nbsp;at&nbsp;your&nbsp;community&nbsp;college&nbsp;that&nbsp;focus&nbsp;on&nbsp;Ancient&nbsp;Greece&nbsp;and&nbsp;Rome&nbsp;(in&nbsp;art&nbsp;history,</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">history,&nbsp;literature,&nbsp;etc.),&nbsp;they&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;accepted&nbsp;for&nbsp;this&nbsp;elective&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;upon&nbsp;review.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">Introductory&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;or&nbsp;Latin&nbsp;courses&nbsp;may&nbsp;also&nbsp;be&nbsp;eligible.</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\"></p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">To&nbsp;request&nbsp;review&nbsp;for&nbsp;course&nbsp;articulation,&nbsp;please&nbsp;submit&nbsp;the&nbsp;course&nbsp;information&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;course&nbsp;syllabus&nbsp;to&nbsp;our</p><p class=\"ql-indent-1\">undergraduate&nbsp;advisor&nbsp;(contact&nbsp;information&nbsp;is&nbsp;below).</p><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Upper&nbsp;Division&nbsp;Required&nbsp;Course</strong></p><p>One&nbsp;course&nbsp;from&nbsp;the&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;130&nbsp;series.&nbsp;Must&nbsp;be&nbsp;taken&nbsp;at&nbsp;UCB&nbsp;in&nbsp;the&nbsp;Department&nbsp;of&nbsp;Ancient&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;and&nbsp;Roman&nbsp;Studies</p><p></p><p><strong>Upper&nbsp;Division&nbsp;Electives</strong></p><p>Five&nbsp;upper-division&nbsp;courses&nbsp;in&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;(including&nbsp;upper-division&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;and&nbsp;Latin)&nbsp;or&nbsp;a&nbsp;closely&nbsp;related&nbsp;field;&nbsp;at&nbsp;least&nbsp;three&nbsp;of</p><p>these&nbsp;must&nbsp;be&nbsp;taken&nbsp;within&nbsp;the&nbsp;department.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Notes:</p><ol><li>One&nbsp;of&nbsp;these&nbsp;five&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;replaced&nbsp;by&nbsp;lower-division&nbsp;language&nbsp;study:&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;1&nbsp;+&nbsp;2,&nbsp;Latin&nbsp;1&nbsp;+&nbsp;2,&nbsp;or&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;or&nbsp;Latin&nbsp;15.</li><li>Any&nbsp;additional&nbsp;AGRS&nbsp;130-series&nbsp;courses&nbsp;you&nbsp;take&nbsp;beyond&nbsp;the&nbsp;required&nbsp;one&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;counted&nbsp;toward&nbsp;these&nbsp;upper-division&nbsp;electives.</li></ol><p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>Pre-Modern&nbsp;Culture&nbsp;Requirement&nbsp;</strong></p><p><em>May&nbsp;potentially&nbsp;be&nbsp;fulfilled&nbsp;by&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;credit</em></p><p>To&nbsp;broaden&nbsp;your&nbsp;perspective,&nbsp;you&nbsp;are&nbsp;required&nbsp;to&nbsp;complete&nbsp;one&nbsp;course&nbsp;(lower-&nbsp;or&nbsp;upper-division)&nbsp;focusing&nbsp;on&nbsp;a&nbsp;pre-modern&nbsp;culture&nbsp;other&nbsp;than&nbsp;the&nbsp;Greco-Roman&nbsp;world.&nbsp;</p><p>This&nbsp;can&nbsp;include&nbsp;cultures&nbsp;that&nbsp;overlapped&nbsp;with&nbsp;the&nbsp;Mediterranean&nbsp;world,&nbsp;such&nbsp;as&nbsp;Ancient&nbsp;Egypt&nbsp;or&nbsp;Mesopotamia.</p><p></p><p>Note:&nbsp;This&nbsp;requirement&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;fulfilled&nbsp;at&nbsp;a&nbsp;California&nbsp;Community&nbsp;College,&nbsp;subject&nbsp;to&nbsp;departmental&nbsp;review&nbsp;and&nbsp;approval.</p><p></p><p><strong>Find&nbsp;Out&nbsp;More</strong></p><p>The<a href=\"https://undergraduate.catalog.berkeley.edu/programs/252G3U\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;Catalog&nbsp;</a>and&nbsp;the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://dagrs.berkeley.edu/undergraduate/majors-and-minors/agrs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">department&nbsp;website</a>&nbsp;provide&nbsp;more&nbsp;information&nbsp;about&nbsp;major&nbsp;requirements&nbsp;and&nbsp;course&nbsp;information.</p><p></p><p><strong>Connect&nbsp;With&nbsp;Our&nbsp;Advisor!</strong></p><p>We&nbsp;understand&nbsp;you&nbsp;may&nbsp;have&nbsp;questions&nbsp;as&nbsp;you&nbsp;plan&nbsp;your&nbsp;transfer!&nbsp;We&nbsp;encourage&nbsp;you&nbsp;to&nbsp;reach&nbsp;out&nbsp;if&nbsp;you&nbsp;have&nbsp;any&nbsp;questions</p><p>about&nbsp;the&nbsp;Ancient&nbsp;Greek&nbsp;and&nbsp;Roman&nbsp;Studies&nbsp;major&nbsp;at&nbsp;the&nbsp;University&nbsp;of&nbsp;California,&nbsp;Berkeley.&nbsp;Your&nbsp;key&nbsp;contact&nbsp;is&nbsp;our</p><p>Undergraduate&nbsp;Major&nbsp;Advisor&nbsp;(UMA):</p><p></p><p><strong>Cassandra&nbsp;Dunn</strong></p><p>Email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:cassandrajj@berkeley.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">cassandrajj@berkeley.edu</a></p><p>Appointments:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://calendly.com/cassandra-dunn-ug-advisor\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Schedule&nbsp;an&nbsp;appointment&nbsp;(in-person&nbsp;or&nbsp;remotely)</a></p><p>Department&nbsp;Website:&nbsp;<a href=\" https://dagrs.berkeley.edu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://dagrs.berkeley.edu</a></p><p>Requests&nbsp;for&nbsp;course&nbsp;articulation&nbsp;to&nbsp;the&nbsp;major&nbsp;may&nbsp;be&nbsp;submitted&nbsp;online&nbsp;after&nbsp;matriculation&nbsp;to&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;to&nbsp;students&nbsp;with&nbsp;a&nbsp;Berkeley&nbsp;email.&nbsp;</p><p>Please&nbsp;note&nbsp;that&nbsp;only&nbsp;courses&nbsp;included&nbsp;in&nbsp;transfer&nbsp;credit&nbsp;can&nbsp;be&nbsp;used&nbsp;to&nbsp;meet&nbsp;requirements.</p>",
        "groupId": "ac5c85b8-5d89-424c-8360-01990c828619",
        "position": 5,
        "area": "General"
      }
